function trTblHTML(){return `<div id="trTblBox">${trTblInner()}</div><p class="tnote">Grade = how he ranks at his position this season compared with the starters a ${TR.n}-team league needs (A is top-tier). Mania = season-long rating. This week = our projection. Outlook is a 0 to 100 rating of how he looks going forward. Steadiness shows how often he reaches starter level (Steady, Mixed, Boom/bust, Low floor). Trend compares his last 3 games of snaps and targets or touches with before. Use View to switch to season stats or the Mania breakdown. Tap any heading to sort.</p>`}
